triage: fix_game: The game over-counts Miscommunications: in the shared-standing scenario each team ended one token too many (b_miscommunications 2 instead of 1, every standing 1 lower than expected). This fits an invalid clue set being charged twice, once at the referee check and again at decoder scoring, when the rules skip straight to the end check. The clue history also stores a valid clue set as one entry, while the rules add each clue separately under the keyword it clued.
