triage: revise_rules: Over five attempts the coder has cycled between two failures, and both come from the design. The interface requires public white_clues/black_clues that start as '', so players are shown blank fields before each reveal. Interceptions and decodes need an exact 3-digit ordered match (1 in 24 for a random guess), and the 2-Miscommunication limit ends random games after about two rounds, so those counters are never seen to change.

